//「翔京がいいスタート切ってんね。
//　ほかはいまいち」
"Shokyo took the lead early. The rest are kinda meh so <br>far."

pt:
//【茶々丸】
<voice name='茶々丸' class='茶々丸' src='voice/md02/0370700a07'>
